<p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">We have received your application and have had the chance to
review it thoroughly.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>We were quite impressed
with your credentials; however, given the large number of high quality applicants
and the limited number of slots, we currently cannot offer you admission into
the MS Psychology program.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">Instead, we would like to place you on a waitlist.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>If a slot opens up, we will extend an offer of
admission to you at that time.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">If you no longer wish to be considered for admission, please
let us know as soon as possible in order to allow other waitlisted applicants
the opportunity to move up on the list.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">If you have any questions about the process, please do not
hesitate to contact me.</font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
